      "content": "those are okay for a general study but theyre a bit too vague for what i need. i need to get more specific so the data is actually useful for the sociology part. like, for example, when we talk about \"high-risk urban\" populations, there are often certain more aggressive traits or specific communication styles—like slang, certain ways of handling authority, or being more reactive to confrontation—that researchers associate with those environments. can u give me some actual scenario questions that test for those specific things? like, scenarios involving conflict or social tension that would help us see if someone has those types of behavioral markers?",
